hema Registry support instead of a live Kafka/Schema Registry service.\\\",\\n  \\\"deterministic_setup\\\": [],\\n  \\\"agent_guidance\\\": \\\"When configuring Confluent schema serializer/serde classes, include `schema.registry.url=mock://<unique-test-scope>` in the config map. Prefer `MockSchemaRegistryClient` or the `mock://` pseudo-protocol for local coverage; do not require a real Schema Registry Docker service unless verification proves the mock path is insufficient.\\\",\\n  \\\"risks\\\": [\\n    \\\"The artifact is a base schema serializer module; concrete Avro/JSON/Protobuf serializers live in sibling artifacts, so tests should avoid depending on those unless intentionally broadening coverage.\\\",\\n    \\\"Some formatter/reader classes may touch Kafka tooling APIs; focus first on schema-id serializers, subject/context strategies, wrapper serializers, and config behavior covered by transitive dependencies.\\\"\\n  ]\\n}\", \"textSignature\": \"{\\\"v\\\":1,\\\"id\\\":\\\"msg_045088c69514068c016a7f7d2d036c81958c65980505f1ff15\\\",\\\"phase\\\":\\\"final_answer\\\"}\"}], \"api\": \"openai-codex-responses\", \"provider\": \"openai-codex\", \"model\": \"gpt-5.5\", \"usage\": {\"input\": 3731, \"output\": 738, \"cacheRead\": 38400, \"cacheWrite\": 0, \"reasoning\": 516, \"totalTokens\": 42869, \"cost\": {\"input\": 0.018655, \"output\": 0.02214, \"cacheRead\": 0.0192, \"cacheWrite\": 0, \"total\": 0.05999499999999999}}, \"stopReason\": \"stop\", \"timestamp\": 1786740001031, \"responseId\": \"resp_045088c69514068c016a7f7d215b8c8195a7d7a0461f4ef609\", \"rawStopReason\": \"completed\"}}\n[recv] {\"type\": \"turn_end\", \"message\": {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": [{\"type\": \"thinking\", \"thinking\": \"**Assessing kafka-tools dependency need**\\n\\n**Analyzing schema.registry.url test configuration**\\n\\n**Evaluating necessity of schema.registry.url setup**\", \"thinkingSignature\": \"{\\\"id\\\":\\\"rs_045088c69514068c016a7f7d21f3108195af2570002af46c